\paragraph{Code ($\Kempirical{=}2$): cross-modality confirmation.}
Python functions from CodeSearchNet~\cite{husain2019codesearchnet} ($n{=}5{,}000$, Qwen2.5-1.5B) yield $\Kempirical{=}2$ (1v2 $\auc = 0.738$, CI $[0.709, 0.767]$; 2v3 $\auc = 0.530$; Table~\ref{tab:code_domain_qwen} in Appendix).
